OL,3,ASouth Korea recalls Ukraine envoy over
OL,4,Aprisoner-of-war row
OL,5,
OL,6,FSouth Korea has said it will recall its
OL,7,Fambassador to Ukraine, the latest
OL,8,Fescalation in a diplomatic spat between
OL,9,Fboth countries.
OL,11,FIt started last month when Ukrainian
OL,12,FPresident Volodymyr Zelensky announced
OL,13,Fthat his government had transferred two
OL,14,Fcaptured North Korean soldiers to
OL,15,FSeoul.
OL,17,FSeoul says Ukraine broke an agreement
OL,18,Fto keep the transfer a secret but
OL,19,FZelensky's office maintains that there
OL,20,Fwas no non-disclosure agreement in
OL,21,Fplace.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,318,300,200,140,0,100
