OL,3,ASouth Korea recalls Ukraine envoy over
OL,4,Aprisoner-of-war row
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe two North Korean soldiers, who were
OL,7,Famong thousands from the country
OL,8,Fsupporting Russia in the Ukraine war,
OL,9,Fhad earlier told local media they
OL,10,Fwanted to be sent to South Korea.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
